{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119830/extras/f992e4b610d346ea5f5d1fefc68d6e25.avif?t=1763491403\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Holiday Story - is a short horror game about Christmas and New Year, set on the eve of 1982. The game's main genre is &quot;Horror&quot;, &quot;Walking simulator&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Plot:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an ordinary man on your way home from a business trip.<br>You promised your son a construction set for Christmas \u2014 but never got the chance to buy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stopping by a brightly lit toy, electronics, and video game store, you step inside, hoping to find the perfect gift\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But soon, strange things begin to happen in the beautifully decorated Christmas shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119830/extras/fd1666855f5c702e01ae4ad7d4af2a52.poster.avif?t=1763491403\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119830/extras/fd1666855f5c702e01ae4ad7d4af2a52.webm?t=1763491403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119830/extras/fd1666855f5c702e01ae4ad7d4af2a52.mp4?t=1763491403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS aesthetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy yet unsettling holiday atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro 1980s setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic sound design.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Estimated playtime: 30\u201340 minutes.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Christmas Atmosphere!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119830/4a98160fbdf3d3f052e9a4fdfb5adba850676896.jpg"},{"name":"Missed the Mark!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119830/b954f827ad34fb9decf41d969968d68f3d933672.jpg"},{"name":"Quit Smoking!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119830/aa6b2629892132fb2c6c3c1b98dfe5995cbe8079.jpg"},{"name":"Friends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119830/25ef10305a7c77cfea0e893c2fa641f508800f5c.jpg"},{"name":"There\u2019s the Salesman!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119830/48e596996002999b1d62ff52eb31b5c80da37956.jpg"},{"name":"Creepy Toy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119830/82832be55ff76919465f8009c9da51acb7a30b10.jpg"},{"name":"The Police Arrived","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119830/3ad45d9b623a921531d75ba87aa55cf203fda171.jpg"},{"name":"The Holiday Story","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119830/6046b866905bdab1a8eba9d7e53a88a494f9c4c1.jpg"},{"name":"Raccoon!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119830/476acb37b7c0f39990b17f514a1fa913558f60f0.jpg"},{"name":"Thanks for playing!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119830/1318f7d56f4076a91a0733a2a1f7a55b25e75087.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119830?t=17634